[Term:noise-run:Noise run]
The stage that closes each round of the title tune, after its second part.
#R$F0E2@tune(The play of the noise run) times its pulses from bytes of the
ROM.

[Term:slide:Slide]
A sound of two or three tones in the title tune's introduction or bridge. It
plays from one record of #R$F043@tune(the title tune slides), which says how.
